# ==============================================================
# .dockerignore — evita copiar lixo pro build context do Docker
# ==============================================================

# .NET
**/bin/
**/obj/
**/*.user
**/*.suo
**/TestResults/

# Flutter (não usado pelo build do backend, mas evita contexto enorme)
**/.dart_tool/
**/.flutter-plugins
**/.flutter-plugins-dependencies
**/.packages
**/build/
**/.pub/

# Git / IDE
**/.git/
**/.gitignore
**/.github/
**/.vs/
**/.vscode/
**/.idea/
**/.cursor/
**/.continue/
**/.aiassistant/
**/.ai-harness/

# Docs e configs locais
docs/
security/
**/*.md

# Segredos e env
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
**/appsettings.Development.json
**/secrets/
